# PETAL PARADE: if nobody is saved for a while Madame Nettle plants a
# toadstool; from 100 saved she plants 2, from 150 saved 3.
game petalparade
wait 5
press A
cheat clear
cheat still
cheat spawns_on
cheat witch 895
wait 10
expect toadstools == 1
cheat saved 150
cheat witch 895
wait 10
expect toadstools == 4
